        drivingExperience: "The 115hp ABK is a significant step up from the base 101hp engine, thanks to multi-point injection. While still slow by modern standards, it feels adequately torquey around town and pulls the heavy A6 C4 chassis with a smooth, predictable linear delivery. It is a relaxed, effortless highway cruiser that prioritizes comfort and extreme longevity over dynamic thrills.",
