            "Timing Belt Snap (Interference) - Ignoring the 90,000 km replacement interval will lead to a snapped belt, causing the pistons to smash all 16 valves.",
            "Fuel Starvation (Pumps) - The system relies on a high-pressure main fuel pump. If it weakens, the mechanical injectors will not atomize fuel correctly.",
            "Heater Core Failure - Standard C4 vulnerability. The matrix bursts, leaking hot coolant onto the passenger side carpet.",
