            timingType: "Belt & Chain (Features a toothed timing belt at the front driving the exhaust camshaft and water pump, paired with a short roller chain at the rear connecting the intake and exhaust camshafts with a hydraulic VVT tensioner).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI / TFSI. High-pressure fuel pump driven directly by a specific lobe on the intake camshaft. Notorious for carbon buildup on intake valves).", engineLifespan: "250,000+ km (The EA113 block is incredibly robust, but its lifespan in the vehicle heavily depends on proactive replacement of the high-pressure fuel pump cam follower and PCV system).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner K03. Fast-spooling turbo providing excellent low-end torque, integrated with the exhaust manifold).", ecuType: "Bosch Motronic MED9.1 (Highly advanced engine management system, exceptionally tuneable via OBD2).", euroStandard: "Euro 4", maxPowerStockInternals: "350+ hp (The EA113 block and forged crankshaft are very strong, but the factory connecting rods will bend if torque exceeds 400-450 Nm).",
