                timingType: "Chain (Complex rear-mounted timing chain system with four chains driving the camshafts and accessories. Servicing requires complete engine removal).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI. Fuel is sprayed directly into the combustion chamber at high pressure. Highly prone to intake valve carbon buildup).", engineLifespan: "250,000+ km (The aluminum block is sensitive to oil starvation and poor maintenance. Longevity heavily depends on timing chain care and regular carbon cleaning).", turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (No turbocharger. Relies on variable intake geometry and direct injection for torque delivery).", ecuType: "Bosch Motronic MED9.1", euroStandard: "Euro 4", maxPowerStockInternals: "280+ hp (Strong rotating assembly, but power gains are severely limited by the naturally aspirated architecture).",
