                drivingExperience: "The 335hp BAT 4.2 V8 provides an intoxicating driving experience. It delivers a relentless, silky-smooth wave of 420 Nm of torque accompanied by one of the best V8 exhaust notes ever produced. It transforms the A6 into an Autobahn missile.",
