                timingType: "Chain (Highly complex rear-mounted timing chain system. Drives four camshafts and accessories. Servicing the prone plastic guides requires dropping the entire engine and transmission).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI. High-pressure fuel system prone to massive carbon buildup on the intake valves, requiring frequent walnut blasting).", engineLifespan: "250,000+ km (The Alusil V10 block is structurally robust, but its lifespan is severely limited by the catastrophic cost of engine-out maintenance and the risk of cylinder scoring).", turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (No turbocharger. Features a complex variable geometry dual-stage intake manifold to optimize torque across the rev range).", ecuType: "Bosch Motronic MED9.1.1 (Dual ECUs are required to manage the 10 cylinders and complex FSI parameters).", euroStandard: "Euro 4", maxPowerStockInternals: "500+ hp (Internals are incredibly strong, but NA tuning yields minimal gains, and forced induction is nearly impossible due to space constraints).",
