                customLightNames: { headlights: ["Headlightmain"], taillights: ["vehiclelights01"], drllight: ["Rdlattempt", "rdlattempt2"] }, author: "Audi A6 C6 (https://skfb.ly/pFVIw) by 🇷🇴シRuletăシ🇷🇴 is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).",
                drivingExperience: "The 580hp BUH RS6 is a physics-defying leviathan. It delivers acceleration that feels like a jet taking off; a relentless, violent surge of 650 Nm of torque that pins you to the seat regardless of the gear or speed. The immense weight is evident in corners, but it is completely masked in a straight line by pure, unadulterated brute force. The twin turbos completely eliminate the low-end lethargy found in the naturally aspirated S6, providing a wave of power that never tapers off.",
                mechanicVerdict: "The C6 RS6 V10 BiTurbo is an absolute masterpiece of excess, but it is one of the most expensive Audis on earth to keep running. The 'engine pull' is required for nearly every major service, including turbo replacements, rear coolant O-rings, and timing chains, meaning labor bills run into the thousands instantly. If you cannot afford to buy two of these cars, you cannot afford to maintain one. It is a hypercar engine trapped in an estate car body."
