                    "Expensive Sensor Glow Plugs - A single glow plug with a pressure sensor can cost over $150, making a full set refresh very costly.",
                    "Oil in Engine Valley - A leak from the oil cooler seals is a labor-intensive job requiring the removal of the intake system and turbocharger.",
