        "Engine-Out Service (Timing) - Despite improved guides, high mileage chain stretch still mandates a total engine removal to fix properly.",
        "Expensive Sensor Glow Plugs - A single glow plug with a pressure sensor is very expensive, making a full set refresh highly costly.",
