    timingType: "Chain (EA888 Gen 3 architecture. Features a vastly improved and highly reliable timing chain and tensioner system compared to Gen 2. Maintenance is generally only required past 150,000 km).", injectionType: "Dual Injection (Combines Direct Injection FSI with Multi-Point Injection MPI. This hybrid system eliminates intake valve carbon buildup and improves efficiency).", engineLifespan: "300,000+ km (A monumental improvement over Gen 2. The block is bulletproof, and oil consumption issues are resolved. Lifespan depends on managing plastic cooling component leaks).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (IHI IS20. Extremely responsive turbo with an electronic wastegate and exhaust manifold integrated into the cylinder head).", ecuType: "Siemens Simos 18.1 (Incredibly fast and sophisticated ECU, making the Gen 3 engine a tuner's dream).", euroStandard: "Euro 6", maxPowerStockInternals: "400+ hp (The Gen 3 bottom end is exceptionally strong, handling Stage 3 upgrades effortlessly).",
