        { name: "Revision D Diverter Valve", description: "Replacing the rubber diaphragm diverter valve on the turbo with the updated OEM piston-style valve.", benefit: "Holds boost reliably and will not tear under load, ensuring the ICE provides maximum power." }, 
        { name: "Walnut Blasting Carbon Clean", description: "Physically blasting the intake valves with crushed walnut shells to remove deeply baked-on carbon deposits.", benefit: "Restores lost horsepower, smooths out the extremely rough transition from EV to ICE mode, and prevents misfires." }, 
        { name: "Latest PCV Assembly", description: "Installing the newest revision of the Positive Crankcase Ventilation valve on the top of the valve cover.", benefit: "Helps mitigate some oil consumption and acts as a cheap insurance policy to protect the rear main seal from blowing out." } 
