    timingType: "Chain (EA837 architecture. Features a complex rear-mounted timing chain system. Upper tensioners can be accessed with difficulty, but addressing stretched lower chains or shattered guides requires pulling the engine entirely).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI. Highly susceptible to severe carbon buildup on the intake valves, severely choking airflow and reducing power output over time).", engineLifespan: "350,000+ km (The aluminum block is very durable. Lifespan is largely determined by maintaining the complex timing chains, regular walnut blasting, and transmission health).", turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (No turbocharger. Relies purely on displacement and Audi Valvelift System for power delivery).", ecuType: "Siemens Simos 8.x (Reliable engine management, though tuning potential is practically nonexistent due to the lack of forced induction).", euroStandard: "Euro 5", maxPowerStockInternals: "350+ hp (Internals are robust, but naturally aspirated limitations mean you will never reach these limits without adding a custom supercharger).",
