    timingType: "Belt (EA288 generation architecture. Toothed timing belt driving the camshafts and the high-pressure fuel pump. The water pump is integrated into the block. Strict 210,000 km replacement interval, but the tensioner is prone to squeaking early).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Utilizes the more reliable Bosch CP4.1 generation with improved materials, though still sensitive to poor fuel).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The EA288 is a massive improvement over the EA189. Being a detuned version, this engine experiences incredibly low thermal stress, ensuring maximum block longevity).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner VNT. Features a water-cooled intercooler integrated directly into the intake manifold for incredibly short intake tracts and rapid response).", ecuType: "Bosch EDC17C64 (Heavily detuned via software for corporate fleet and tax bracket restrictions in certain markets).", euroStandard: "Euro 6", maxPowerStockInternals: "240+ hp (The block is bulletproof, structurally identical to the 150hp and 190hp variants).",
