    timingType: "Belt (EA288 architecture. Features a toothed timing belt driving the camshafts and the high-pressure fuel pump. The water pump is integrated into the block. Strict 210,000 km interval, but the tensioner bearing is prone to early wear).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch CP4.1 generation with improved internals, combined with Euro 6 AdBlue/SCR injection).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The core block is incredibly robust. The major threats to its lifespan are the complex cooling system and the highly sensitive AdBlue emissions equipment).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner VNT. Features a highly efficient water-cooled intercooler integrated directly into the intake manifold for zero turbo lag).", ecuType: "Bosch EDC17C64 (Highly advanced engine management, orchestrating dual EGR systems and the SCR/AdBlue catalytic process).", euroStandard: "Euro 6", maxPowerStockInternals: "260+ hp (The EA288 block is bulletproof, easily handling Stage 2/3 power. The factory DL382 transmission clutch is the primary limitation).",
