    timingType: "Chain (Highly complex rear-mounted timing chain system. Features revised tensioners compared to the C6 generation, but high-mileage stretch and upper tensioner rattle still occur. Full chain replacement requires engine removal).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch EDC17 with Piezoelectric injectors and the Bosch CP4.2 high-pressure fuel pump).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The iron block is incredibly strong, operating under very low thermal stress due to the detuned software. Lifespan is threatened primarily by CP4 fuel pump failure).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner VNT. Highly efficient with minimal lag, optimized for low-end torque rather than top-end power).", ecuType: "Bosch EDC17CP44 (Software detuned to meet corporate fleet requirements and lower tax brackets).", euroStandard: "Euro 5", maxPowerStockInternals: "350+ hp (Structurally identical to the higher-output 245hp models, making the block virtually unburstable).",
