        "Intake Manifold Swirl Flap Wear: The actuator motor or internal linkages wear out over time, causing a P2015 error code and putting the car in limp mode.",
        "Oil Cooler Seals: The seals for the oil cooler located deep in the engine V-valley leak, causing oil and coolant to mix or leak down the back of the block.",
        "Upper Timing Chain Rattle: The hydraulic tensioners for the upper camshaft chains lose oil pressure overnight, causing a loud 1-3 second rattle on cold starts.",
