    timingType: "Chain (Highly complex EA897evo rear-mounted timing chain system. Features heavily revised tensioners compared to the pre-facelift models, making it much more reliable, though high-mileage stretch can still occur. Full chain replacement requires engine removal).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch EDC17 with advanced Piezoelectric injectors, Bosch CP4.2 high-pressure fuel pump, and Euro 6 SCR/AdBlue injection).", engineLifespan: "450,000+ km (The iron block is legendary, but the sequential twin-turbo setup, immense heat generation, and complex AdBlue emissions equipment require rigorous maintenance to achieve this lifespan).", turboType: "Bi-Turbo (Sequential Twin-Turbocharger system. Uses a small variable-geometry turbo (VGT) for instantaneous low-end response, which bypasses to a massive fixed-geometry turbo at higher RPMs).", ecuType: "Bosch EDC17CP54 (Highly sophisticated dual-turbo and SCR management. Exceptionally receptive to tuning).", euroStandard: "Euro 6", maxPowerStockInternals: "450+ hp (The EA897evo block is heavily reinforced for the BiTDI application and can easily handle extreme torque).",
